{"translation-revision-date":"2025-02-05 09:24-0500","generator":"WP-CLI\/2.11.0","source":"dist\/js\/interface.RETIRE-SAVINGS.gpl.js","domain":"messages","locale_data":{"messages":{"":{"domain":"messages","lang":"en","plural-forms":"nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);"},"en":["ro"],"Please use the backspace key to delete.":["V\u0103 rug\u0103m s\u0103 folosi\u021bi tasta backspace pentru a \u0219terge."],"Left, up & down arrow keys are disabled. So are the home, end, pgup and pgdn keys.":["Tastele s\u0103geat\u0103 st\u00e2nga, sus \u0219i jos sunt dezactivate. La fel \u0219i tastele home, end, pgup \u0219i pgdn."],"Use backspace to delete.":["Folosi\u021bi backspace pentru a \u0219terge."],"If value is selected, just start typing new value to clear prior value.":["Dac\u0103 valoarea este selectat\u0103, \u00eencepe\u021bi s\u0103 introduce\u021bi o nou\u0103 valoare pentru a \u0219terge valoarea anterioar\u0103."],"When a number is selected (value shown in inverse), use right arrow key to clear selection without clearing value. Then backspace to edit.":["Atunci c\u00e2nd este selectat un num\u0103r (valoarea este afi\u0219at\u0103 invers), utiliza\u021bi tasta s\u0103geat\u0103 dreapta pentru a \u0219terge selec\u021bia f\u0103r\u0103 a \u0219terge valoarea. Apoi ap\u0103sa\u021bi tasta backspace pentru a edita."],"TIP: Generally it is best to use the TAB or SHIFT-TAB keys to move from one input to the next or previous input.":["SUGESTIE: \u00cen general, este mai bine s\u0103 utiliza\u021bi tastele TAB sau SHIFT-TAB pentru a trece de la o intrare la urm\u0103toarea sau la cea anterioar\u0103."],"TIP 2: Generally, editing a value is inefficient. Since values are auto selected, just type the number you want.":["SFATUL 2: \u00cen general, editarea unei valori este ineficient\u0103. Deoarece valorile sunt selectate automat, tasta\u021bi pur \u0219i simplu num\u0103rul pe care \u00eel dori\u021bi."],"Do not type the thousand separator character.":["Nu introduce\u021bi caracterul de separare a miilor."],"(If using U.S. convention, that would be the comma.)":["(Dac\u0103 utiliza\u021bi conven\u021bia SUA, aceasta ar fi virgula.)"],"I'm smart enough to enter them for you!":["Sunt suficient de inteligent s\u0103 le introduc pentru dumneavoastr\u0103!"],"An unknown date calculation error occurred.":["S-a produs o eroare necunoscut\u0103 de calcul al datei."],"Please provide us with your inputs and settings so that we can fix this. Thank you.":["V\u0103 rug\u0103m s\u0103 ne furniza\u021bi datele de intrare \u0219i set\u0103rile dvs., astfel \u00eenc\u00e2t s\u0103 putem remedia problema. V\u0103 mul\u021bumim."],"Date is not valid - bad year.":["Data nu este valabil\u0103 - an gre\u0219it."],"Jan":["ian."],"Feb":["feb."],"Mar":["Mar"],"Apr":["Apr"],"May":["Mai"],"Jun":["Iun"],"Jul":["Iul"],"Aug":["Aug"],"Sept":["Sept"],"Oct":["Oct"],"Nov":["Nov"],"Dec":["Dec"],"Error: dates out of sequence.":["Eroare: datele nu se succed."],"Exception":["Excep\u0163ie"],"occurred when accessing":["a ap\u0103rut la accesarea"],"Invalid index":["Indice invalid"],"YTD":["Cumul Anual"],"Running Totals":["Totale cumulative"],"Your Personalized Retirement Schedule":["Graficul dumneavoastr\u0103 personalizat de pensionare"],"Retirement Plan Summary":["Rezumatul planului de pensionare"],"Total Investment":["Investi\u021bia total\u0103"],"Number of Investments":["Num\u0103rul de investi\u021bii"],"Return on Investment (ROI)":["Rentabilitatea investi\u021biei (ROI)"],"Total Gain":["C\u00e2\u0219tig total"],"Gain on Investment":["C\u00e2\u0219tig din investi\u021bie"],"Last Cash Flow Date":["Data ultimului flux de numerar"],"Years":["Ani"],"Investment Schedule":["Grafic de investi\u021bii"],"Year":["Anul"],"Date":["Data"],"Investment":["Investi\u021bie"],"Investment Gain":["C\u00e2\u0219tig din investi\u021bie"],"Net Change":["Varia\u021bie net\u0103"],"Balance":["Sold"],"Annual Investment":["Investi\u021bie anual\u0103"],"Annual Interest":["Dob\u00e2nd\u0103 anual\u0103"],"Annual Investment Gain":["C\u00e2\u0219tig anual din investi\u021bie"],"Change in Balance":["Modificarea soldului"],"Annual Investment and Interest Totals":["Totaluri anuale ale investi\u021biei \u0219i dob\u00e2nzii"],"Accumulated Investment and Interest":["Investi\u021bie \u0219i dob\u00e2nd\u0103 acumulate"],"Amount Invested & Interest as Percentage of Total Value":["Suma investit\u0103 \u0219i dob\u00e2nda ca procent din valoarea total\u0103"],"\"Net Change\" is change from prior period i.e. prior balance plus investment, plus gain on investment (interest).":["\"Varia\u021bia net\u0103\" reprezint\u0103 varia\u021bia fa\u021b\u0103 de perioada anterioar\u0103, adic\u0103 soldul anterior plus investi\u021bia, plus c\u00e2\u0219tigul din investi\u021bie (dob\u00e2nda)."],"Running Investment":["Investi\u021bie cumulat\u0103"],"Running Interest":["Dob\u00e2nd\u0103 cumulat\u0103"],"Running Investment Gain":["C\u00e2\u0219tig cumulat din investi\u021bii"],"Total Deposits":["Total depozite"],"Total Interest Earned":["Dob\u00e2nda total\u0103 c\u00e2\u0219tigat\u0103"],"Total Value":["Valoarea total\u0103"],"Pct. of Total":["Pct. din total"],"Your Personalized Cash Flow Schedule":["Graficul dvs. personalizat de flux de numerar"],"Current age must be greater than 0.":["V\u00e2rsta actual\u0103 trebuie s\u0103 fie mai mare dec\u00e2t 0."],"\"Retirement Age\" must be greater than \"Current Age\"":["\"V\u00e2rsta de pensionare\" trebuie s\u0103 fie mai mare dec\u00e2t \"V\u00e2rsta actual\u0103\""],"Retirement Savings Calculator \u2014 calculate savings required to reach retirement goal":["Calculatorul de economii pentru pensionare - calculeaz\u0103 economiile necesare pentru a atinge obiectivul de pensionare"],"<p>This calculator easily answers the question \"Given the value of my current investments how much do I need to save each month to reach my retirement goal?\"<\/p>":["<p>Acest calculator r\u0103spunde u\u0219or la \u00eentrebarea \u201eAv\u00e2nd \u00een vedere valoarea investi\u021biilor mele actuale, c\u00e2t trebuie s\u0103 economisesc \u00een fiecare lun\u0103 pentru a atinge obiectivul de pensionare?\u201d<\/p>"],"<p>The user enters their \"Current Age\", their expected \"Retirement Age\", the \"Annual Interest Rate (ROR)\" (annualized Rate-of-Return one expects to earn) and \"Amount At Retirement\" (the goal amount).<\/p>":["<p>Utilizatorul introduce \u201eV\u00e2rsta Curent\u0103\u201d, \u201eV\u00e2rsta de Pensionare\u201d estimat\u0103, \u201eRata Anual\u0103 a Dob\u00e2nzii (ROR)\u201d (Rata de Rentabilitate anualizat\u0103 pe care se a\u0219teapt\u0103 s\u0103 o ob\u021bin\u0103) \u0219i \u201eSuma la Pensionare\u201d (suma \u021bint\u0103).<\/p>"],"<p class=\"tail\">The calculator quickly calculates the required monthly investment amount and creates an investment schedule plus a set of charts that will help the user see the relationship between the amount invested and the return on the investment.<\/p>":["<p class=\"tail\">Calculatorul calculeaz\u0103 rapid suma necesar\u0103 de investi\u021bie lunar\u0103 \u0219i creeaz\u0103 un program de investi\u021bii, plus un set de grafice care ajut\u0103 utilizatorul s\u0103 vad\u0103 rela\u021bia dintre suma investit\u0103 \u0219i rentabilitatea investi\u021biei.<\/p>"],"<p class=\"small\" style=\"font-size: 85%; line-height: 1.5; color:red; user-select: text\">If you need a more advanced \"Retirement Calculator\" - one that calculates many more unknowns and one that calculates assuming retirement <b>income<\/b> and not a final lump sum then try the calculator located here: <b>https:\/\/AccurateCalculators.com\/retirement-calculator<\/b><\/p>":["<p class=\"small\" style=\"font-size: 85%; line-height: 1.5; color:red; user-select: text\">Dac\u0103 ave\u021bi nevoie de un \u201ecalculator de pensionare\u201d mai avansat - unul care calculeaz\u0103 mai multe necunoscute \u0219i care calculeaz\u0103 presupun\u00e2nd un <b>venit<\/b> de pensionare, nu o sum\u0103 final\u0103, \u00eencerca\u021bi calculatorul de aici: <b>https:\/\/AccurateCalculators.com\/retirement-calculator<\/b><\/p>"],"<p class=\"small\" style=\"font-size: 85%; line-height: 1.5; color:red; user-select: text\">Need more options including the ability to solve for other unknowns? Ability to create, in one schedule, the pre-retirement and post-retirement cashflow? Print the chart? Export to MS Word&trade; (.docx) or MS Excel&trade; (.xlsx) files? Please visit, <b>https:\/\/AccurateCalculators.com\/retirement-calculator<\/b><\/p>":["<p class=\"small\" style=\"font-size: 85%; line-height: 1.5; color:red; user-select: text\">Ave\u021bi nevoie de mai multe op\u021biuni, inclusiv posibilitatea de a rezolva alte necunoscute? Capacitatea de a crea, \u00eentr-un singur grafic, fluxul de numerar \u00eenainte \u0219i dup\u0103 pensionare? Tip\u0103ri\u021bi graficul? Exporta\u021bi \u00een fi\u0219iere MS Word&trade; (.docx) sau MS Excel&trade; (.xlsx)? V\u0103 rug\u0103m s\u0103 vizita\u021bi: <b>https:\/\/AccurateCalculators.com\/retirement-calculator<\/b><\/p>"],"Prepared for":["Preg\u0103tit pentru"],"Address":["Adres\u0103"],"City, State  ZIP":["Ora\u0219, Jude\u021b, Cod po\u0219tal"],"Prepared On":["Preg\u0103tit la"],"Prepared by":["Preg\u0103tit de"],"Phone":["Telefon"],"Email":["E-mail"],"Website":["Site web"],"Unknown":["Necunoscut"],"u":["n"],"U":["N"],"Dates must be the first of the month.":["Datele trebuie s\u0103 fie prima zi a lunii."],"An invalid JavaScript date object.":["Un obiect de dat\u0103 JavaScript nevalid."],"Monthly":["Lunar"]}}}